Changes to github.com/yzhou216/flake under test, as a diff against
1dd2043, under the terms of that repository:

  b58263a iris: accept the module arguments of nix-darwin
  514dc90 commons: drop the settings of the disabled networkmanager
  85c4c94 lexi: explain why the nixbld group id is set
  85f84e5 scripts: switch to the iris configuration in darwin_setup.sh
  fe8c766 scripts: match only the sip status line in darwin_setup.sh
  0de62cd scripts: pass the password to sudo verbatim in darwin_setup.sh
  a87eaa1 scripts: run darwin-rebuild as root in darwin_setup.sh
  9c3780b t3code: export the themes with the modus themes of emacs 30

